{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GAL","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"加拉太书","commonName":"加拉太书","title":"加拉太书","order":48,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"562313e310c6f1d94ed5129ace17d69a34c96343930aaf2d9c844748b71d8bf4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GAL/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":149},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["各人的重担要互相担当"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄们，若有人偶然被过犯所胜，你们属灵的人就当用温柔的心把他挽回过来；又当自己小心，恐怕也被引诱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你们各人的重担要互相担当，如此，就完全了基督的律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["人若无有，自己还以为有，就是自欺了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["各人应当察验自己的行为；这样，他所夸的就专在自己，不在别人了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为各人必担当自己的担子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在道理上受教的，当把一切需用的供给施教的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["不要自欺， 神是轻慢不得的。人种的是什么，收的也是什么。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["顺着情欲撒种的，必从情欲收败坏；顺着圣灵撒种的，必从圣灵收永生。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我们行善，不可丧志；若不灰心，到了时候就要收成。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以，有了机会就当向众人行善，向信徒一家的人更当这样。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警告和祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["请看我亲手写给你们的字是何等的大呢！"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["凡希图外貌体面的人都勉强你们受割礼，无非是怕自己为基督的十字架受逼迫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他们那些受割礼的，连自己也不守律法；他们愿意你们受割礼，不过要借着你们的肉体夸口。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但我断不以别的夸口，只夸我们主耶稣基督的十字架；因这十字架，就我而论，世界已经钉在十字架上；就世界而论，我已经钉在十字架上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["受割礼不受割礼都无关紧要，要紧的就是作新造的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["凡照此理而行的，愿平安、怜悯加给他们，和 神的以色列民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["从今以后，人都不要搅扰我，因为我身上带着耶稣的印记。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["弟兄们，愿我主耶稣基督的恩常在你们心里。阿们！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GAL/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EPH/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GAL/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}